<!--
	The launcher foreground: one Sudoku cell - a 3x3 grid with six of its nine squares filled (app_icon.svg).

	The artwork is the 90x90 cell out of that SVG, mapped onto the 66dp safe zone of the 108dp adaptive
	canvas, so nothing is lost to a round, squircle or teardrop mask.

	Two deliberate departures from the source SVG:
	- The rules are 1.6 units wide, not the 0.73 the 90 -> 66 scale would give. At 48px in a launcher the
	  geometrically correct hairline all but disappears; the colour is untouched.
	- The digits are Noto Sans outlines baked into paths, because a VectorDrawable has no text element. The
	  ink is #1B1B1F rather than pure black so the icon does not out-contrast everything around it.
-->
